{
    "title": "Trucker Guide: Navigation Tool",
    "description": "The Trucker Guide app - is a brand-new trucker app that helps you find places you need. Browse parking spots, weigh stations, useful waypoints, or groups of services. Select individually or all at once to see their location on the Map. Get their contacts, hours of operation, and detailed information to make your road trip safe and comfortable. \r\n\r\n  \r\n>>> Explore our ADVANTAGES\r\n\r\n\u2014 Truck drivers update parking availability in real-time. Check Truck Parking status indicated as FULL, SOME, or EMPTY to avoid long waitings and exhausting lines.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Weigh stations & Scales nearby. Browse the nearest Weigh stations & scales on your Path. The icon indicators will get you information on Open/Close statuses or DOT inspection.  \r\n\r\n\u2014 Real-time Fuel prices:  Up-To-Date Fuel prices on your mobile device.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Live-Cam Access. Monitor Road Conditions to have a heads up on traffic jams.\r\n \r\n\u2014 Available offline. Trucker Guide stores your ongoing workflow locally to keep you up and running in case of internet interruption. \r\n\r\n\r\n>>> Plan your best route with a list of over 23,600 US business locations and services for Truckers. \r\n\r\n\u2014 Parking & Stores such as Pilot Flying J, Walmart, Love\u2019s Travel Center, Petro TA and TA Truck with hundreds of reviews from Truck drivers.\r\n\r\n\u2014 A list of available services like Rest Areas, Truck Stops with showers, Laundries, Truck Washes, Home Parking, Weigh Stations, Truck Parts, Truck Washes, Tire Shops, Truck Repairs, Road Assistance, Scales, Oil & Lube, Truck Dealers, Trailer Dealers and more. \r\n\r\n\r\n>>> We stand behind innovation and high performance.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Trucker Guide has a simple and intuitive user interface.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Due to innovative data processing technology, Trucker Guide is extremely stable even on slow mobile devices.\r\n\r\n\u2014 The app consumes a minimum of your mobile device resources to save your battery life.\r\n\r\n\r\n>>> Download Trucker Guide - the ALL IN ONE app that accompanies you wherever you\u2019re going. <<<",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Trucker Guide app - is a brand-new trucker app that helps you find places you need. Browse parking spots, weigh stations, useful waypoints, or groups of services. Select individually or all at once to see their location on the Map. Get their contacts, hours of operation, and detailed information to make your road trip safe and comfortable. <br><br>  <br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Explore our ADVANTAGES<br><br>\u2014 Truck drivers update parking availability in real-time. Check Truck Parking status indicated as FULL, SOME, or EMPTY to avoid long waitings and exhausting lines.<br><br>\u2014 Weigh stations &amp; Scales nearby. Browse the nearest Weigh stations &amp; scales on your Path. The icon indicators will get you information on Open/Close statuses or DOT inspection.  <br><br>\u2014 Real-time Fuel prices:  Up-To-Date Fuel prices on your mobile device.<br><br>\u2014 Live-Cam Access. Monitor Road Conditions to have a heads up on traffic jams.<br> <br>\u2014 Available offline. Trucker Guide stores your ongoing workflow locally to keep you up and running in case of internet interruption. <br><br><br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Plan your best route with a list of over 23,600 US business locations and services for Truckers. <br><br>\u2014 Parking &amp; Stores such as Pilot Flying J, Walmart, Love\u2019s Travel Center, Petro TA and TA Truck with hundreds of reviews from Truck drivers.<br><br>\u2014 A list of available services like Rest Areas, Truck Stops with showers, Laundries, Truck Washes, Home Parking, Weigh Stations, Truck Parts, Truck Washes, Tire Shops, Truck Repairs, Road Assistance, Scales, Oil &amp; Lube, Truck Dealers, Trailer Dealers and more. <br><br><br>&gt;&gt;&gt; We stand behind innovation and high performance.<br><br>\u2014 Trucker Guide has a simple and intuitive user interface.<br><br>\u2014 Due to innovative data processing technology, Trucker Guide is extremely stable even on slow mobile devices.<br><br>\u2014 The app consumes a minimum of your mobile device resources to save your battery life.<br><br><br>&gt;&gt;&gt; Download Trucker Guide - the ALL IN ONE app that accompanies you wherever you\u2019re going. &lt;&lt;&lt;",
